OL,3,GNEWSAPolice dog who faced
OL,4,Aknife-wielding man wins award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey Police dog and his handler who
OL,7,Fsafely detained a man wielding a knife
OL,8,Fhave won a national bravery award.
OL,10,FTwo-year-old German shepherd, Frankie,
OL,11,Fand PC Eddie Cabrera, 39, from Horsham
OL,12,Fin West Sussex, were six months into
OL,13,Fthe role when they were called to the
OL,14,Fincident in Leatherhead in February.
OL,16,FPhilip Kinnaird, 46, from Leatherhead,
OL,17,Fwas convicted of threatening a person
OL,18,Fwith a blade or sharply pointed article
OL,19,Fin a public space and sentenced to two
OL,20,Fyears in prison at Chichester Crown
OL,21,FCourt on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
