OL,3,GNEWSAPolice dog who faced
OL,4,Aknife-wielding man wins award
OL,5,
OL,6,FWinning the Outstanding Bravery Award
OL,7,Ffrom the Thin Blue Paw Foundation, a
OL,8,Fnational dog welfare charity, Cabrera
OL,9,Fsaid Frankie "didn't cower or shy away
OL,10,Fat all, he was so brave".
